# Planning (NeverLeft)

- **Source of truth:** [`plans/`](plans/) in this repository, especially [`plans/forgotten_item_feature_ux_d218206d.plan.md`](plans/forgotten_item_feature_ux_d218206d.plan.md) for the active roadmap.
- When planning features or using Plan mode: read and update those markdown files; do not rely only on `~/.cursor/plans/` on the local machine.
- After changing a plan, keep `plans/README.md` build order / status table accurate when scope or priority shifts.
